{
  "action": "In general, a standard system update will make all the necessary changes.",
  "cves": [
    "CVE-2026-40685",
    "CVE-2026-40687",
    "CVE-2026-40686"
  ],
  "description": "It was discovered that Exim incorrectly handled parsing malformed JSON\nin message headers. A remote attacker could possibly use this issue to\nexecute arbitrary code. (CVE-2026-40685)\n\nIt was discovered that Exim incorrectly handled processing of UTF-8\ntrailing characters. A remote attacker could possibly use this issue to\nobtain sensitive information. (CVE-2026-40686)\n\nIt was discovered that Exim incorrectly handled SPA authenticator input.\nAn authenticated user could possibly use this issue to execute arbitrary\ncode. (CVE-2026-40687)",
  "id": "USN-8228-1",
  "isummary": "Several security issues were fixed in Exim.",
